  {
   "text": "A real one.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She came to the yard with coffee and bad news.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Sell it, Ant.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "The crane, the land, the list.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "You are nineteen.\"",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "I showed her the stamp from the chimney.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "H and K.",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": "stamp",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "She went quiet.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she changed the subject.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "We tried Grandpa's office.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "The door was locked.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And when I drove Daisy past it, she beeped.",
   "nefes": 1.05,
   "mark": "beep",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Twice.",
   "nefes": 0.35,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "There was nothing on the hook.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Defne looked at my phone.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Study notes?\"",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "Defne"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was not study notes.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was a tower, halfway down.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I put it in my pocket.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I checked the mailbox.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
